---
E0101: LIF tau_mem too small for effective dt in layer 0
Why: tau_mem=0.5000 ms is ≤ dt=1.0000 ms; the membrane would lose all history within one step (ADR-0005 guard, ADR-0008).
Fix: set tau_mem > 1.0000 ms when constructing the LIF layer.
Docs: https://docs.thrindex.com/errors/E0101
